ent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>那后市会怎么走？首先我们定义这波下跌只是洗盘，还会创新高。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>那现在就1个问题，是直接V型反转，还是先回调之后再涨。我们来复盘一下。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-w